---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { profile } from "@/settings";
---

<Layout title="Research | Dr. Aditya Bhattacharyya">

  <div class="prose max-w-none">

    <!-- Research Overview -->
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">
      Research
    </h1>

    <div class="mb-12">

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
        My research interests lie at the interface of synthetic organic
        chemistry, photochemistry, and reaction technology, with a particular
        focus on developing practical and efficient methods for the synthesis
        of structurally complex molecules of relevance to medicinal and
        pharmaceutical chemistry.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
        My academic research has focused extensively on the synthesis and
        reactivity of strained small-ring heterocycles, including aziridines
        and related nitrogen-containing compounds, as well as the development
        of new ring-opening and functionalization strategies. During my
        postdoctoral research in Germany, I worked extensively on visible-light
        photochemistry and copper-mediated photoredox catalysis.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
        In my current industrial research activities, these interests are
        complemented by a strong emphasis on synthetic methodology,
        reaction development, and enabling technologies for pharmaceutical
        discovery. My work includes photochemical transformations,
        cross-coupling chemistry, continuous-flow processing, and the
        development of robust synthetic routes for complex small molecules.
      </p>

    </div>


    <!-- Research Areas -->
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">
      Research Areas
    </h2>

    <div class="grid gap-8 mb-12">

      {
        profile.research_areas.map((area) => (
          <div class="flex gap-5 items-start">

            <div class="mt-1 shrink-0">
              <div class="size-3 rounded-full bg-accent"></div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">
                {area.title}
              </h3>

              <p class="text-base leading-relaxed">
                {area.description}
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        ))
      }

    </div>


    <!-- Scientific Themes -->
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">
      Scientific Themes
    </h2>

    <div class="grid gap-6 mb-12">

      <div class="card bg-base-200">
        <div class="card-body">

          <h3 class="card-title text-lg">
            Photoredox &amp; Photochemical Synthesis
          </h3>

          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            Development of visible-light-driven synthetic transformations,
            including copper photoredox chemistry and radical-based
            functionalization strategies for the construction of valuable
            organic molecules.
          </p>

        </div>
      </div>


      <div class="card bg-base-200">
        <div class="card-body">

          <h3 class="card-title text-lg">
            Small-Ring Heterocycle Chemistry
          </h3>

          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            Synthesis, activation, ring opening, and functionalization of
            strained heterocycles, particularly aziridines, azetidines, and
            related nitrogen-containing small-ring systems.
          </p>

        </div>
      </div>


      <div class="card bg-base-200">
        <div class="card-body">

          <h3 class="card-title text-lg">
            Synthetic Methodology
          </h3>

          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            Design and development of new synthetic methods involving
            carbon–carbon, carbon–nitrogen, carbon–oxygen, and carbon–sulfur
            bond formation, with an emphasis on selectivity, efficiency,
            and practical applicability.
          </p>

        </div>
      </div>


      <div class="card bg-base-200">
        <div class="card-body">

          <h3 class="card-title text-lg">
            Reaction &amp; Process Technology
          </h3>

          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            Application of flow chemistry, photochemical reactors,
            continuous-flow hydrogenation, reaction screening, and modern
            purification technologies to improve synthetic processes and
            enable efficient preparation of complex molecules.
          </p>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>


    <!-- Research in Drug Discovery -->
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">
      Research in Drug Discovery
    </h2>

    <div class="mb-12">

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
        My industrial research experience has involved the application of
        synthetic organic chemistry to pharmaceutical discovery programs.
        This includes developing synthetic routes, solving challenging
        chemical problems, and delivering practical methodologies for the
        preparation and diversification of complex small molecules.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
        A major emphasis of this work is the translation of modern synthetic
        chemistry into reliable and scalable laboratory processes suitable
        for discovery and development environments.
      </p>

    </div>


    <!-- Research Philosophy -->
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">
      Research Philosophy
    </h2>

    <div class="mb-8">

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed">
        I am particularly interested in chemistry that combines fundamental
        mechanistic understanding with practical synthetic utility. My
        approach is to identify new reactivity, understand the underlying
        reaction mechanisms, and translate these insights into efficient
        synthetic methods that can address real challenges in molecular
        synthesis and drug discovery.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>

</Layout>
